---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Orbwalker"
  description="Orbwalker is a fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile, with free orb movement and build-driven runs."
  image="/img/orbwalker.jpg"
>
  <h1>Orbwalker</h1>
  <p>
    A fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile. You drag one orb anywhere on the board, and every orb it passes
    moves out of the way.
  </p>

  <div class="figure"><img src="/img/orbwalker.jpg" alt="Orbwalker title screen" width="720" height="405" /></div>

  <p>
    A run is a string of fights, shops and relics. You pick up upgrades as you go, and enemies show their
    next move so you can plan around it.
  </p>
  <p>I built it on my own, from an empty project to a playable game, in three months.</p>

  <div class="shots">
    <img src="/img/orbwalker-combat.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker combat" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
    <img src="/img/orbwalker-shop.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker shop" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
    <img src="/img/orbwalker-relic.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker relic choice" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
  </div>

  <p>
    <a href="https://rajahafify.itch.io/orbwalker">Play it on itch.io</a> or
    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/yOek_scKUMY">watch the short</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
